      "title": "Swimmer dies after being bitten by shark off popular Perth beach",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/sep/18/swimmer-dies-after-being-bitten-by-shark-off-popular-perth-beach",
      "description": "<p>Locals describe their shock at witnessing the incident at Sorrento beach on Friday morning</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/sep/18/labor-migration-plan-tony-burke-coalition-qantas-renewable-energy-ntwnfb\">Follow our Australia news live blog for latest updates</a></p></li><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>A man has died after being bitten by a shark off Sorrento beach in Perth’s north.</p><p>Emergency services were called to the popular beach at about 10.30am on Friday after reports of a shark-related incident.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/sep/18/swimmer-dies-after-being-bitten-by-shark-off-popular-perth-beach\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-09-18T09:52:55"
    },
